OL,3,AUK tries to stop Trump's diesel export
OL,4,Aban
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealey, who admitted that UK diesel
OL,7,Fprices are "extreme", said the
OL,8,Fgovernment was in discussions with the
OL,9,FUS, adding: "We're also making the
OL,10,Fprovision that we may need to and we
OL,11,Fhave our own stocks in the UK."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
